    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Expanding National Industrial Gases Company&rsquo;s (GAS) plants by developing two new air separation plants at the company&#39;s complexes in Jubail and Yanbu industrial cities. Each plant has an output capacity of 3,000 tons/ day of oxygen. The plants will meet the requirements of SABIC&rsquo;s expansion projects in Jubail and Yanbu</p>\r\n",
